---

<Base
  title="Master in Advanced Architecture — Sebastián Ortiz de Zevallos"
  description="Studies at the Institute for Advanced Architecture of Catalonia."
  currentPage="projects"
>
  <article class="project">
    <div class="project__year">2022–23 · Research</div>
    <h1 class="project__title">Master in Advanced Architecture</h1>
    <p class="project__subtitle">Institute for Advanced Architecture of Catalonia (IAAC)</p>

    <div class="project__body">
      <p>
        These projects are part of the process and outcomes of the multiple
        courses and workshops I took during my time at IAAC, where I studied and
        explored "advanced" techniques and methodologies for architecture, such
        as: 3D printing, CNC, laser cutting, algorithmic design and new ways of
        thinking of structures.
      </p>

    </div>

    <Gallery
      slug="master-advanced-architecture"
      images={["01.jpg", "02.jpg", "03.jpg", "04.png"]}
      alt="Master in Advanced Architecture"
    />

    <div class="meta">
      <div><a href="/projects">← All projects</a></div>
      <div>2022–23</div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
